---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout title="Careers">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>

        <span>/ Careers</span>
      </div>

      <h1>
        Good work begins
        <br />
        with <em>curious people.</em>
      </h1>

      <p class="lead">
        People who ask thoughtful questions, care about the details and want to understand how
        things work together.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap prose compact-page">
    <h2>Work that connects disciplines</h2>
    <p>
      Software, data, AI and infrastructure projects involve more than one kind of expertise.
      Understanding the user’s workflow, explaining technical choices and preparing a useful
      handover are part of the work alongside implementation.
    </p>
    <p>
      Explore our <a href="/company/how-we-work/">delivery approach</a> for the questions we bring
      to a project, or our <a href="/services/">capabilities</a> for the disciplines across the
      company.
    </p>

    <h2>Current opportunities</h2>

    <p>
      No vacancies are listed on this website at present. Open positions will include the location,
      role requirements and application process when available.
    </p>

    <div class="content-actions">
      <a class="button" href="/company/">
        Explore Soft Task <Icon />
      </a>

      <a class="button" href="/services/">
        See our capabilities <Icon />
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
